1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:04,629
Welcome to Melody and
Barnaby's Music Nuggets!

2
00:00:05,629 --> 00:00:11,177
Today we are going to
learn about notes together.

3
00:00:13,177 --> 00:00:21,186
Remember? Every note is a sound… we
can play one note… and then another.

4
00:00:24,386 --> 00:00:29,052
Let's play three notes…
one… after another.

5
00:00:31,852 --> 00:00:34,302
Notes one after another make a tune.

6
00:00:34,352 --> 00:00:36,612
A tune is also called…

7
00:00:36,662 --> 00:00:38,752
a melody.

8
00:00:38,802 --> 00:00:40,511
Just like me!

9
00:00:43,111 --> 00:00:47,869
Now let's play the same
notes… all at the same time.

10
00:00:49,769 --> 00:00:53,366
Notes played together… make harmony.

11
00:00:54,566 --> 00:00:59,882
A group of notes played
together has a name… a chord.

12
00:01:02,482 --> 00:01:08,540
And this is our friend… Harmony!
She loves notes that play together.

13
00:01:11,940 --> 00:01:16,606
Listen again. One by one… a melody.

14
00:01:19,306 --> 00:01:21,649
Together… harmony.

15
00:01:23,449 --> 00:01:27,882
Harmony sounds fuller…
like a hug of notes.

16
00:01:30,482 --> 00:01:37,377
On the stave… notes one after
another… go side by side.

17
00:01:40,177 --> 00:01:43,960
Notes together… stack
on top of each other.

18
00:01:46,960 --> 00:01:50,139
Your turn! Look and listen.

19
00:01:50,539 --> 00:01:53,486
Together… or one by one?

20
00:01:57,586 --> 00:01:58,954
Together!

21
00:02:00,754 --> 00:02:03,608
Together… or one by one?

22
00:02:07,908 --> 00:02:09,648
One by one!

23
00:02:11,448 --> 00:02:16,206
Look at the stave.
Together… or one by one?

24
00:02:20,306 --> 00:02:21,674
Together!

25
00:02:22,574 --> 00:02:23,896
You've got it!

26
00:02:25,796 --> 00:02:27,257
Now it's your turn!

27
00:02:27,457 --> 00:02:32,540
Play Together or One by One
and hear the difference!

28
00:02:34,340 --> 00:02:39,070
Grown-ups, subscribe so
you never miss a Nugget.

29
00:02:39,120 --> 00:02:42,814
New ones every Wednesday and Saturday.

30
00:02:43,114 --> 00:02:45,503
See you for the next Nugget!

